# Force LF on everything textual, regardless of the checkout platform.
#
# This is not a style preference. The labs and the Go toolchain wrapper are bash
# scripts that run in git-bash, in Docker and inside a kind node. A CRLF shebang
# line does not merely look wrong, it stops the script from executing at all,
# with an error that names a command nobody typed. Windows checkouts default to
# converting LF to CRLF, so without this file cloning the repo on Windows breaks
# every script in it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary, so git never rewrites bytes inside them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pfx binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
